# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo is worked on from a Windows PC and a MacBook, and it lives inside a
# synced Drive folder — so the working tree itself gets copied between the two
# machines outside of git. Windows git checks out CRLF by default; the Mac then
# sees a carriage return on every line and reports all five pages plus the scripts
# as modified, producing a diff of thousands of lines that contains no real change.
#
# eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf, so both machines keep an LF working tree and the
# phantom diff cannot come back.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.docx binary
